sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Engine as 推理引擎
    participant GPU_Compute as GPU 算力单元 (Tensor Core)
    participant GPU_Memory as GPU 显存带宽 (HBM)

    Client->>Engine: 发送 Prompt (长输入)
    Note over Engine,GPU_Compute: Prefill 阶段：算力受限 (Compute-Bound)
    Engine->>GPU_Compute: 一次性大矩阵乘法处理全部输入 Token
    GPU_Compute-->>GPU_Memory: 将生成的初始 KV Cache 写入显存
    Engine-->>Client: 返回首字 (TTFT)

    Note over Engine,GPU_Memory: Decode 阶段：访存带宽受限 (Memory-Bound)
    loop 逐字自回归生成 (TBT 间隔)
        Engine->>GPU_Memory: 读取全部历史 KV Cache (高频显存搬运)
        Engine->>GPU_Compute: 单 Token 向量矩阵计算
        GPU_Compute-->>GPU_Memory: 增量追加新 Token 的 KV
        Engine-->>Client: 流式返回下一个 Token
    end
